":"그래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":199.341097,"end":200.758181,"text":"現実だ！","translation":"현실이다!","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":200.791093,"end":203.750298,"text":"もう逃げだしたくても今を生きるしかない！","translation":"이제 도망치고 싶어도 지금을 살아갈 수밖에 없어!","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":203.791085,"end":204.071084,"text":"まえを","translation":"앞을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":204.091084,"end":204.966342,"text":"みろよ","translation":"봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":204.991082,"end":205.949697,"text":"現実だ！","translation":"현실이다!","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":206.191079,"end":208.771071,"text":"さぁ武器を取って納期に締切ぶっ倒せ！","translation":"자 무기를 들고 납기와 마감을 때려눕혀!","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":208.791071,"end":209.571069,"text":"これは","translation":"이건","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":209.591069,"end":209.96618,"text":"そうだ","translation":"그래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"82","start":209.991068,"end":211.074721,"text":"現実だ！","translation":"현실이다!","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":211.191065,"end":213.858517,"text":"とにかく勉強勉強勉強勉強やりまくれ！","translation":"일단 공부 공부 공부 공부 죽도록 해!","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"84","start":214.091057,"end":214.841278,"text":"まえに","translation":"앞으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"85","start":214.891055,"end":215.365,"text":"すすめ","translation":"가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"86","start":215.491053,"end":216.658063,"text":"現実だ！","translation":"현실이다!","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"87","start":216.69105,"end":218.774997,"text":"今四の五の言わずに達成したあと笑い出せ！","translation":"이제 잔말 말고 해낸 다음 웃어 버려!","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"88","start":219.191043,"end":220.816522,"text":"ねぇ君は","translation":"있지 너는","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"89","start":220.991038,"end":222.741554,"text":"この歌を聴いて変われるの？","translation":"이 노래를 듣고 변할 수 있어?","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"90","start":222.791033,"end":224.571028,"text":"いつから本気出すの？","translation":"언제부터 진심을 낼 거야?","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"91","start":224.591028,"end":226.216507,"text":"さぁ今こそ","translation":"자 바로 지금","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"92","start":226.291024,"end":229.458623,"text":"